{"id":"q49iaxixjb22xnjauepzu96co","title":"某程序员开源 Mac 应用切换器 Switcher，解决多任务内存冲突","originalTitle":"Switcher (2004)","summary":"某程序员在1984年离开 Apple 后，于1985年完成首个版本 Switcher，通过分离内存区解决多应用运行时的内存碎片问题。在与 Microsoft 的合作中，需兼容其伪代码编写的 Word 应用，最终通过动态调试解决兼容性。该成果被 Steve Jobs 估值 10 万美元，成为 Mac 系统标准组件，影响后续多任务操作系统设计。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜"},"links":{"original":"https://folklore.org/Switcher.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-13T03:14:59.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-13T13:41:05.974Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-13T13:41:05.974Z","category":"dev-tools","tags":["新项目","技术方案","GitHub"],"score":72,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"dca42f69-bae4-47db-986d-9faf9657724c","title":"某程序员开发Switcher解决Mac多任务内存冲突并成为系统标准组件"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"dca42f69-bae4-47db-986d-9faf9657724c","title":"某程序员开发Switcher解决Mac多任务内存冲突并成为系统标准组件"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fEk19hi5AH8Y","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}